  - key: PAYTABLE_LINE_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>30 Lines</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: <size=22>- Any combination of 3 Scatter symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers
      Free Games during Base Games.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: <size=22>appears on reels 1 and 3 only.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_3
    value: <size=22>                      ,                 , and                 
      appear on reel 5 only.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>WILD</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_4
    value: <size=22>- Wild substitutes for all symbols except Scatter symbol.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_5
    value: <size=22>                      ,                 , and                 
      appear on reel 5 only.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>EXTRA BET</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<size=21>

      - 150% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to enable Extra
      Wilds Feature and Free Games.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>WILD METERS</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=21>\n- Each bet level has corresponding Wild Meters:\n\n               
      Mega Free Games meter,                 Major Free Games \n\nmeter,                
      Minor Free Games meter and                 Base\n\nWild meter.\n\n- The initial
      number of Wilds in the Mega Free Games meter is 50.\n\n- Each             on
      reel 5 increases the Mega Free Games meter by 1 Wild.\n\n- When the Mega Free
      Games meter reaches 125 Wilds or more, awards 10 Mega Free Games.\n\n- After
      Mega Free Games has been played, the Mega Free Games meter resets to 50 Wilds.\n\n-
      The initial number of Wilds in the Major Free Games meter is 40.\n\n- Each            
      on reel 5 increases the Major Free Games meter by 1 Wild.\n\n- When the Major
      Free Games meter reaches 100 Wilds or more, awards 10 Major Free Games.\n\n-
      After Major Free Games has been played, the Major Free Games meter resets to
      40 Wilds.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: '<size=21>

      - The initial number of Wilds in the Minor Free Games
      meter is 30.


      - Each             on reel 5 increases the Minor Free
      Games meter by 1 Wild.


      - When the Minor Free Games meter reaches 75
      Wilds or more, awards 10 Minor Free Games.


      - After Minor Free Games
      has been played, the Minor Free Games meter resets to 30 Wilds.


      - The
      initial number of Wilds in the Base Wild meter is 5.


      - Each            
      on the reels increases the Base Wild meter by 1 Wild.


      - When the Base
      Wild meter reaches 50 Wilds or more, awards Extra Wilds Feature at the next
      spin.


      - After Extra Wilds Feature has been played, the Base Wild meter
      resets to 5 Wilds.


      - The number of Wilds in each Wild Meter is saved
      separately for each bet level.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>EXTRA WILDS FEATURE</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5_1
    value: "<size=21>\n- The Extra Wilds Feature may be awarded during the reel spin
      of any Base Game that does not award Wilds or Free Games.\n\n- Also, the Extra
      Wilds Feature is awarded after the Base Wild meter reaches 50 or more Wilds.\n\n-
      If the Extra Wilds Feature is awarded, 1 or more symbol positions on the reels
      turn to             .\n\n- If a selected symbol position already has           
      , that symbol position becomes            , a Multiplier Wild.\n\n- Whenever
      the symbol position with any Wild gets selected, the multiplier increases by
      1x, up to 5x.\n\n- 1 Wild gets deducted from the Base Wild meter whenever a
      symbol position is transformed into a Wild or a symbol position already with
      any Wild gets selected.\_\n\n- If more than 1 Multiplier Wilds are part of
      a line win, award the sum of Multipliers from those Multiplier Wilds to the
      pay for that win line.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_6_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>MEGA FREE GAMES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_6_1
    value: "<size=21>\n- Combination of 2              on reels 1 and 3 & 1            
      on reel 5, or the Mega Free Games meter reaching 125 Wilds or more, awards
      10 Mega Free Games with the number of Wilds in the Mega Free Games meter corresponding
      to the bet level.\n\n- Free Games cannot be re-triggered during Free Games.\n\n-
      During the reel spin of any Free Game, 1 or more symbol positions on the reels
      may turn into             . A different number of symbol positions may be transformed
      during each Free Game.\n\n- If a selected symbol position already has           
      , that symbol position becomes             , a Multiplier Wild.\n\n- Whenever
      the symbol position with any Wild gets selected, the multiplier increases by
      1x, up to 5x.\n\n- 1 Wild gets deducted from the Mega Free Games meter whenever
      a symbol position is transformed into a Wild or a symbol position already with
      any Wild gets selected.\_\n\n- If more than 1 Multiplier Wilds are part of
      a line win, award the sum of Multipliers from those Multiplier Wilds to the
      pay for that win line.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_7_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>MAJOR FREE GAMES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_7_1
    value: "<size=21>\n- Combination of 2              on reels 1 and 3 & 1            
      on reel 5, or the Major Free Games meter reaching 100 Wilds or more, awards
      10 Major Free Games with the number of Wilds in the Major Free Games meter
      corresponding to the bet level.\n\n- Free Games cannot be re-triggered during
      Free Games.\n\n- During the reel spin of any Free Game, 1 or more symbol positions
      on the reels may turn into             . A different number of symbol positions
      may be transformed during each Free Game.\n\n- If a selected symbol position
      already has            , that symbol position becomes             , a Multiplier
      Wild.\n\n- Whenever the symbol position with any Wild gets selected, the multiplier
      increases by 1x, up to 5x.\n\n- 1 Wild gets deducted from the Major Free Games
      meter whenever a symbol position is transformed into a Wild or a symbol position
      already with any Wild gets selected.\_\n\n- If more than 1 Multiplier Wilds
      are part of a line win, award the sum of Multipliers from those Multiplier
      Wilds to the pay for that win line.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_8_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>MINOR FREE GAMES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_8_1
    value: "<size=21>\n- Combination of 2              on reels 1 and 3 & 1            
      on reel 5, or the Minor Free Games meter reaching 75 Wilds or more, awards
      10 Minor Free Games with the number of Wilds in the Minor Free Games meter
      corresponding to the bet level.\n\n- Free Games cannot be re-triggered during
      Free Games.\n\n- During the reel spin of any Free Game, 1 or more symbol positions
      on the reels may turn into             . A different number of symbol positions
      may be transformed during each Free Game.\n\n- If a selected symbol position
      already has            , that symbol position becomes             , a Multiplier
      Wild.\n\n- Whenever the symbol position with any Wild gets selected, the multiplier
      increases by 1x, up to 5x.\n\n- 1 Wild gets deducted from the Minor Free Games
      meter whenever a symbol position is transformed into a Wild or a symbol position
      already with any Wild gets selected.\_\n\n- If more than 1 Multiplier Wilds
      are part of a line win, award the sum of Multipliers from those Multiplier
      Wilds to the pay for that win line.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_9_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>LINES</style></b>
